<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">ƐFI - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Ɛfishiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba ƐFISHIYA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɛfishiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛfi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba</para>
  <para style="mt1">ƐFISHIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Introduction</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu kwɔlɛ Ɔpɔlu gba a ka le kwuyengwu lɔri lopo undu e yi mu ugu igbomo mu Oromu awu. Kwupu kwɔle ɔ ka laa Ɔshɔshi uwu Ɛfisu kɛɛkyi mo, igbomo ikyo ɛshɔshi iyifo iyi bɔkɔ i yi kɛlɛɛ mbala Ɛfisu awu tete. Kwuye kwɔngu, Ɛfisu akwu kwuse ungwɔkwu. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ungwu gba akwu ɛkɛka iyi ɛshɔshi lɛɛbi le.</para>
  <para style="ip">Reshi ingyi iso iyi Ɔpɔlu mu kwupu kwɔlɛ akwu meka iyi ikpakya, mbala egbo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e yi yi "kaa enzu mbala apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi moshi mbala ɛzhi, la ngbɛlɛ yi le lomesu mu idu iyi Okrasi. Ɔpɔlu a zɔ tee, akwu kwuwongu ikpakya ɛlɛ gba Wambwalu lɛɛbi akwu ɛdɔ ikpɛnyi mu Ɔzhizɔsi le. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ifate lɔ gyi esu. E shi Wa mbwalu ɔkpa uwu iŋɔma mbala esu laa idɛnyi iyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu iyemo iyi kwupu kwɔlɛ, Ɔpɔlu e siso meka iyi ikpakya. A zɔ ewo iyi Ada Ɔsu Ukpo a ŋa enzu wu, a gba laa ingbomo mbo a kpamba akwɛyi a wamba ma mu rinye ingyi ingbomo mbo kwuwongu luku undu Umɛ uwu Ukpo, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, ewo iyi bɔkɔ iso ishimɛzhi iyɛkwu iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ i nyɔlɔma mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e wo. Mu kwupu kwɔlɛ o fya aba gyɔɔ iyi i zɔ ikpakya iyi enzu umba Ukpo kwuwongu ilomesu mba mbala Okrasi: ɔshɔshi e yi kyamate ɛnwu iyi onzu tayi, Okrasi ba akwu reshi ingyi ɛnwu ɛnyi; ɔshɔshi e yi kyamate ugu tayi, Okrasi ba akwu kwokyi ungwu ɔla uwu ugu awu; ɔshɔshi e yi kyamate oko uwɔnu tayi, Okrasi ba akwu ɔnu uwu oko awu. Akwu kwuwongu idɛnyi mbala isabo mbala igbala ingbomo ikpa mbala esheshi mbala ɛsɛsɛ iyi Okrasi gba apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo le. Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi kaa la fya iduma ma le.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu iyemo(1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okrasi mbala Ɔshɔshi(1.3-3.21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwunyɔ ungwepo mu Okrasi(4.1-6.20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso(6.21-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu uzilɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mu inyama iyi Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Mi kakwupu kwɔlɛ la wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ɛfɛsɔ umba bɔkɔ o ra gbagiri mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi imbwaluma. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Mi lɛ Edego-ala mbala Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te, le shi yi esheshi wu mbala egbo iyi iŋɔma iyi oloto.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esheshi Iyi Kwundu Iyi I Yi Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Iduma akwiyi Ukpo, ete wu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ e shi nzu esheshi iyoshi iyinayina iyi kwundu kwuwongu ki kyo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kwuwongu a ŋa nzu te la ki kwu enzu umba wu dɛdɛdɛ i shi e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le kaa la ki kwu enzu wa pɛriri umba o yi kuto mu idu wu mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Kwuwongu idɛnyi wu, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Ukpo a ka yi mekyeki te, la ki kwu ɛmɛ wu kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Ɛlɛ gba akwu ɔnyɛ mbala igyima wu le. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />E wo ɛlɛ te kaa la ki du wu ma kwuwongu esheshi iyawu iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ e shi nzu rɛshi kwuwongu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, umɛ uwu idu wu. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Okrasi a wa nzu ma mu rinye akwɛyi a gbala ingbomo nzu a kpa kwuwongu ɛnzhi wu. Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kwuwongu esheshi wu i yi gyɔɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Esheshi iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo nzu le, e shi te kaa la ki yi ilukwu kaa la ki yitu iyi iso wu. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Ukpo a zɔ nzu kwunvyeru ungwu egbo wu, ungwu bɔkɔ a ka te ee wo yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi kwuwongu ɛlɛ gba ii shi wu ubwu uruwu le. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ukpo ee wo iyi bɔkɔ a ka te ee wo gba kwuye kwu bo, akwɛyi apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi moshi mbala ɛzhi lɛɛbi a ngbɛ yi reshi e lomesu akwɛyi ee shi Okrasi te lakwu u to keyi yi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ukpo a ŋa nzu akwɛyi a ngbɛ nzu reshi e lomesu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi, kwuwongu a ka yi mu egbo wu diridiri te ee wo yi tayi awu, uwu ee shi iyinayina te li wo kyamate bɔkɔ i yi mu egbo wu tayi, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />kaa kinzu Azhu umba bɔkɔ ki kwu enzu umba kwonze umba bɔkɔ ki fulo egbo mu Okrasi awu, akwɛyi ki gbo Ukpo oya kwuwongu inzumbɛku wu. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Lunyi enzu umba Ɛfisu ba lu kyo lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu pwa iso iyi ototo, iso iyi esheshi iyi isama. Tabɔkɔ lu na iso ɛnyi mu egbo yi akwɛyi Ukpo a ka yi kɛzɔ wu, gba akwu kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri uwu bɔkɔ e shi yi mate bɔkɔ e so e shi mɛzhi awu. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo ele gba akwu kɛzɔ unga bɔkɔ ka zɔ te Ukpo ee shi nzu apula iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ te ee shi nzu awu, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ba sa nzu ma kinzu umba ki kwu enzu wu kaa lo gbo Ukpo oya kwuwongu inzumbɛku wu.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Lɛ Ukpo Laa Enzu Umba Ɛfisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ngba te mi pwa te lu nyama la Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala idɛnyi ipumo yi iyi wa mbwalu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwo yi kwuyengwunanguna ungwu mi lolo mbaa yi mu Ukpo ilɛma mi. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Mi koko mi nda Ukpo ete wu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi nzu, ete nzu uwu e yi inzumbɛku te, le shi kwundu Ɔkɛrikɛri ungwu ilukwu kaa la zɔ ɛnwu wu ma la yi, kaa iyitu yi iyi Ukpo li kyomo. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Mi kyo mi lɛ te Ukpo la wu yi eyi mo kaa la lu zɔngɔma eyi ifulomo iyi bɔkɔ a ya yi awu, mbala esheshi iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ te ee shi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba wu awu, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />mbala imbulama iyi ekpasu wu, inyi gba ii mbwa nzu ma kinzu umba bɔkɔ ki nyama la wu awu. Ekpasu ɛnyi akwu ekpasu iyɛku, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo ɛduma ma yi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ e yi Okrasi ma mu lukwu akwɛyi e shi wu a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi wu moshi, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Okrasi gba e ri ɛsu iyi uwewe mɔmɔ le kala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo umbeshi kala ɛndu iyira. Kunzu ungwu inzumbɛku wu ku ka kunzu ungwu onzu uwakwu uwunawuna ma uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu ɔyi ɔlɛ la ɔyi uwu kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Akwɛyi Ukpo e shi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛsu mu apula iyinayina akwɛyi e shi wu te lakwu u to keyi kwuwongu kaa wa mbwalu wu lo fya esheshi ma, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />wa mbwalu o yi kyamate ɛnwu wu tayi, Ɔzhizɔsi e shi ekpasu wu lɛɛbi la wa mbwalu, uwu gba ba a nyɔlɔ iyinayina ma le.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpo A Sa Nzu Ma Mbaa Lukwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Mekyi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo lu yi kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o tayi kwuwongu lu lo Ukpo ma mo, lu gba lu ngbo la Ukpo mo. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Kwuye kwɔngu lu mbwalu ɔgwuzɛ uwu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ. Lu mbwalu onzu uwoyi awu, ɔsu uwu ɛndu iyira mu oshi. Ɛndu iyira ɛlɛ i yi mu ɛduma iwomo mu egbo iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo Ukpo ma mo. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Kinzu, Azhu lɛɛbi tete ki yi kyamate umba te kwuye ungwekyi. Ki wo kiya ingyi ingbomo ingyi egbo nzu i gyi, ki yi mu kiya ingyira ingyi ki gyi te la ki wo le mbala ingyi ki kamasa te la ki wo le mu iwomo. Kinzu ki kwu enzu umba ingbomo kyamate uwewe te, akwɛyi Ukpo e wo amba mbala nzu. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ Ukpo ba e pwu idɛnyi nzu gyɔɔ, eyembembyi wu ba i mbulama munyi nzu. <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Kinzu ki yi kyamate umba bɔkɔ o kpomo mo-o awu, tetete Ukpo e shi nzu ki yi kwunyɔ mu Okrasi. Esheshi iyi Ukpo gba i sa yi ma le. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Ukpo e yi nzu mo mu lukwu mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi kwuwo ngwɔlɛ e kyo nzu mesu mbala Okrasi, e shi nzu mu ukpa uwɛsu moshi. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Idɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a zɔ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi i zɔ te Ukpo e shi esheshi iyɛku laa enzu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ukpo a sa yi ma kwuwongu esheshi wu kwuwongu lunyi lu kwu idu lu fulo mawu, moo akwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyesheshi yi mo. Akwu rɛshi ingyi Ukpo. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ukpo a sa yi ma akwu kwuwongu ɛduma iyesheshi iyi lu wo mo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwunawuna le kwu ɛnwu mo. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Kinzu ki kwu ɛduma iyi Ukpo e wo mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi kaa la ki wo ɛduma iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a nɔngɔ e shi nzu mekyekyi kaa la ki wo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinzu Ki Kwu Wakpɛnyi Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ lunyi enzu umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo awu, la lu lolo iyimo yi kwuye uŋwekyi. Azhu o ya yi te &lt;&lt;Enzu umba kworiyo&gt;&gt; umba ba o ya ɛnwu mba te &lt;&lt;Wazɛsɔ ma&gt;&gt; ɛsɔ izɛma ba akwu kiya ingyi anzɔnu o wo mu ɛnwu mba. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Lunyi la lu lolo te kwuye kwɔngu lu yi Okrasi mo. Lunyi lu kyo mu enzu umba Isirɛ mo, lunyi ba lu kyo mu kenzu igyirima unga Ukpo mo. Lunyi lu yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lu yi Ukpo mo ba lu fulo eyi te lu fya wu mo. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Lunyi lu ndama lu shi Ukpo kwuye ungwekyi, kekelele ba lu kyo mesu mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. Ukpo e bo ye kɛlɛ mbala wu, i zɛ mu ɛnzhi umba Okrasi. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Moo Okrasi mafyi wu gba e bo la oloto mekeka iyi Azhu mbala umba akwu Azhu mo le. Mu kwuye ungwekyi kwogyigakwu ka Azhu ma mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, kekelele ba Okrasi e shiri kwogyiga kwɔngu ma a, akwɛyi uzhi uwu enzu wepo mbɔlɛ o vindɔ onzu ukpɛnyi ŋa. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Lukwu undu Okrasi ba lu ngbɛ ɛrama ɛnyi ma kaa le kyo Azhu mbala umba akwu Azhu mo mesu kaa lo kwu enzu wakpɛnyi. Mu iwomo ɛlɛ te, Okrasi e shi oloto le yi mekeka iyi Azhu mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />I zɛ mekeka iyi lukwu undu Okrasi bɔkɔ e kpomo mu kwuwɛyi awu, gba Azhu mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, o wo anya iyi esu fo le. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Okrasti e bo a tanu iyi i ŋɔma iyi oloto la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, mbala Azhu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />kwuwongu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Okrasi e wo e shi nzu le, gba Kwundu uwu Ukpo a mbwa la Azhu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo ma kaa lo bo mbaa Ada ɔsu Ukpo.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo le, lu kwu agboga fo. Lunyi ba lu kwu uzhi ukpɛnyi mbala enzu umba Ukpo ŋa, lu kwu enzu umba kwogba ungwu Ukpo. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Lunyi, tete, o mbo yi mu ɔla uwu bɔkɔ wa zɛ ilɔ mbala anukenzu gba o bɔ wu mɛzhi le, kwokyi ungwu bɔkɔ kwu rala ugu awu gba akwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi le. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Uwu gba akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ra la ugu ele ngyɔɔ akwɛyi e shi wu kaa la bulɔma kyamate ɔtɛpu uwu bɔkɔ o shi wu Ɔkwu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mu Okrasi gba lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo o ngbɛ yi o lo mesu mbala nzu mu Kwundu kaa la ki kwu ɔtɛpu uwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo a ŋɔma.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="ms">Ɛduma Iyi Ɔpɔlu E Wo Laa Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ AKwu Azhu Mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ gba Imi Ɔpɔlu mi kwu onzu u gbo ugu ugyi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kwuwo yi, lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kwu Azhu mo le.<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Lunyi lu pwa yi-e, esheshi iyi Ukpo e shi mi te la mi wo yi ɛduma. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ukpo a zɔ mi amasa wiyi bɔkɔ i nvyemo, kyamate bɔkɔ mi ka yi kwonze awu.<verse eid="EPH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Lunyi lu wa iyi bɔkɔ mi ka le ma dɛ gba lu yitu te Imi mi zɔngɔma iso iyi kwunvyeru ungwu Okrasi ma le. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Mu kwuyengwu enzu mbekyi o shi mbo kaa lo yitu iyi ɛlɛ mo. Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba a wuyi ma la enzu wa zɛ ilɔ mbala anukenzu wa kɛrikɛri kekelele e. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Kwunvyeru kwɔlɛ akwu mu ilɔ iyesheshi iyi Ukpo gba enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo mbala Azhu o ri esheshi iyi Ukpo kya le, o kwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi, o ri iyi Ukpo e so e shi mɛzhi meka iyi Okrasi kya.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ukpo e shi mi esheshi wu mbala ekpasu wu iyɛku kaa la mi wo wu ɛduma iyi anu itama iyi ilɔ iyesheshi. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Imi uwu bɔkɔ mi nyɛma mi ka umbwambwa uwu enzu umba Ukpo mo le lala; Ukpo e shi mi esheshi wu kaa la mi tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyɛku iyi Okrasi ɛlɛ la enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e wo kiya ingyinangyina le gba a ŋa mi kaa la mi zɔ uwewe iso iyi kwunvyeru ungwu bɔkɔ a da zɔ onzu uwunawuna dɛ mo. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kwuwongu kaa la ra la wa mbwalu wu kaa la zɔ ilukwu wu laa asu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi idomo moshi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Ukpo e wo ɛlɛ kaa iyi a ra yi mu egbo wu ngbaa mekyi awu la nyɔlɔ yi ma mu Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />I zɛ meka iyi Okrasi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo ma wu, ki turu ki gba la Ukpo fɔɔ mu egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ mi kpa yi ɛshɛku te ɛnwu yi li tumo kwuwongu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu imama kwuwo yi mo, moo inyashi ɛlɛ lɛɛbi akwu kwuwongu esheshi i ya yi.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɛnyi Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ mi bɔ epunu mi mɛzhi midu iyi Ada, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />uwu bɔkɔ e wo apula iyinayina moshi mbala ɛzhi, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />mi lɛ Ukpo te, le shi mi inzumbɛku wu iyɛku ɛnyi kaa le shi yi ekpasu iyi Kwundu wu, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />akwɛyi mi lɛ Ukpo te Okrasi e mbo kwogba wu midu nzu i zɛ mu ikwu idu fulo. Mi lɛ Ukpo kpɔ te lunyi lu do te li yi akpa mbala ɔla mu idɛnyi, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />kaa lunyi mbala enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi lo yitu iyi wowa mbala wɔzhi mbala ibulɔma mbala indomo iyi idɛnyi iyi Okrasi, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />kaa la lu yitu iyi idɛnyi ɛlɛ iyi bɔkɔ i ka iyitu mo lɛɛbi - kaa luzɛ yi la lu yi kyamate undu Ukpo tayi.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Imi mi nda Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e do te e wo iyinaiyina iyi bɔkɔ i ka iyi ki nda naa iyi ki bi egbo ma yi mu ekpasu wiyi bɔkɔ iyi mu ɛduma iwomo ma nzu, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />te inzumbɛku lakwu iyawu mu egbo iyi wa mbwalu wu, mbala meka iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ! Ami.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ikpakya Mu Ɔshɔshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu, uwu bɔkɔ mi kwu u gbo ugu ugyi ugyi kwuwongu Ɔkwu awu, mi kpa yi ɛshɛku te la lu zɛ luzɛ undesheshi undu lu zɔ te lunyi lu kwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi kego. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />La lu kwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o to ɛmba o fulo kadu mo, la lu kwu enzu umba o yi egbo mɛzhi, la lu yidu mbala esu, gba onzu e ngbo yi mo lala la lu pwu idɛnyi wu bi. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />La lu wo ekpasu ka lu ŋɔ moloto mbala esu, ka ilomesu iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e lo nzu awu, li rima. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Ɛnwu mbala Kwundu akwu ikpɛnyi, kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya yi ma ka la lu yi eyifulomo ikpɛnyi mbala nzu awu. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ɔkwu nzu akwu ukpɛnyi, ikwu idu lu fulo nzu akwu ikpɛnyi, obatisima nzu tete akwu ukpɛnyi; <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Ukpo akwu ukpɛnyi, uwu gba akwu ete wu wa mbwalu lɛɛbi le. Uwu gba akwu ɔsu uwu uwewe le, e yi ma nzu ba e wo ɛduma ma nzu. Kwundu wu kwu yi mu enzu wu lɛɛbi.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Uwewe nzu ba Okrasi e shi wu rɛshi ingyi Kwundu wu ikikɔ ikikɔ . <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;kwuyengwu Ɔzhizɔsi a yama a ka moshi, e shi agewa wu mizhikembo akwɛyi e shi enzu wu rɛshi ingyi apula iyesheshi iyesheshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Iluma iyi &lt;&lt; a yama a ka moshi&gt;&gt; i yi te? Iluma yi gba i yi te, Okrasi gba a kalama e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le tete. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ a kalama e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, u wuwu gba a yama a ka moshi le tete. E wo tayi ka le yi mu uwewe.) <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />A kwu uwu gba a ŋa enzu umbafo te lɔ kwu wa zɛ ilɔ, umbafo lɔ kwu anukenzu, umbafo lɔ kwu wa tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo, akwɛyi umbafo ba lɔ kwu wazɔ wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi iso iyi Ukpo le. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />A ŋa enzu mbɔlɛ te ka la nɔngɔ enzu wa mbwalu ma ka lo wo wu ɛduma, kaa lo mbo ɛnwu iyi Okrasi. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Akwɛyi ki kyomesu kaa la ki kwu enzu wakpɛnyi mu ikwu idu lu fulo nzu mbala mu iyitu nzu iyi Umɛ uwu Ukpo; kinzu ki kwu enzu umba bɔkɔ ki kɔma, bɔkɔ ki yi kyamate Okrasi tayi.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Gba ki wo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, ki yi kyamate ɛmɛshɛri mo. Kwokpo ungwu enzu wa kyoromo mbala wa mulo mu iso iyi Ukpo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu ga la enzu ganga awu, kwu do nzu ingbɛbu mu ongbulolo uwu Ukpo mo. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Kinzu ba la ki pwu idɛnyi iyesu, la ki tanu iyi Okrasi mu ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo kaa la ki bulɔma nzhii ba ki yi kyamate u to keyi nzu, Okrasi tayi mu luzɛ nzu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Wa mbwalu wu lɛɛbi, Okrasi a ngbɛ mba e lo mesu kyamate ingyi iyi bɔkɔ i ra la ɛnwu iyi onzu tayi. Gba wa mbwalu o gyi esu akwɛyi onzonzu e wo ɛduma iyi Ukpo e shi wu, akwɛyi ipwudɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi iyi uwewe i kyomo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">La Lu Zɛ Luzɛ Undu Enzu Umba Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, mi so yi shɛ mu ekpasu iyi Edego-ala te, la lu zɛ luzɛ kyamate enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo, bɔkɔ egbo ibyima mba iyɔkpɔɔ akwu iyi umbwa . <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Egbo mbo i semo mba iso iyi Ukpo. kwuwongu o yi Ukpo mo, akwɛyi o kyo ɔ kɛgba ma awu, o yi ogbo uwu kwunyɔ ungwepo ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />O yi lovya mo, o ra la ɛmba o shi la apula iyira iyi lovya; ɔ gyi ira iwomo iyɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lunyi ba akwu tayi gba lu vɔngɔ luzɛ undu Okrasi le mo. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Imi egbo mi i ka epo mo te, ɛza iyi Ɔzhizɔsi bɔkɔ lu pwa yi mbala izɔma iyi bɔkɔ ɔ zɔ yi mu reshi wu awu, akwu ongbulolo uwu e ngyi munyi wu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Wazɔ yi ɛzu, ɔ zɔ yi te la lu lafya la luzɛ undekyi izɛma, mo undu gba lu ye yi mu ikyoromo akwɛyi lu ye yi mu itutumo le. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Kekelele la lu to ɛyi lu shi Ukpo kaa la mbwa yi ma kaa la lu ŋanga luzɛ yi ma. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />La lu zɛ luzɛ undepo undu ototo mbala lu kɛrikɛri undu bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi te lɔ zɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Kwuwo kwɔngu, uwewe la lafya la imulo imuma kaa la ki so esu ongbulolo, moo kinzu lɛɛbi ki kwu ɛmɛnɛ mu Okrasi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />&lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ wo amba, ki nyama kaa ngbomo mo&gt;&gt; Ki ra la amba umba onzu nzhii ba ɔnu lu bomo mo, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />La lu shi onzu uwoyi kapa mo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwɛlɔ, la lafya la ɛlɔ iwuma. Le wo ɛduma mu ewo wu kaa la sa ugɔ wu ma mbala igɔ iyi ayirewa.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />La lu nyama kaa iso iyira li wɔ mu kenzu yi mo. Iso iyi bɔkɔ i mbwa la enzu ma, ii shi mbo o bulɔma gba li wɔ mu kenzu yi le. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ikyo kpɔɔ, la lu shi Kwundu uwu Ukpo amba mo, mo uwu gba akwu kɛzɔ unga Ukpo a ma nzu le, te ki kwu enzu umba wu, te ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ombu, a wa nzu ma. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />La lu lafya la apula iyira ɛlɛ te iwomo: amba umbira, itumo duruduru, onzu ikyɛma, ari ikpama mbala luzɛ undura undunanduna. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />La lu zɔ esu ari iyesheshi, la lu kpo lukwu undu esu. Kyamate bɔkɔ, Ukpo a gba la ingbomo yi a kpa yi kwuwongu Okrasi awu, lunyi tete la lu gba yi lu kpa esu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Luzɛ Mu Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Kwuwongwu lunyi lu kwu ɛmɛ umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi mba awu, la lu mondo luzɛ wu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Mu iwomo yi kwɔfyi kwɔfyi la lu koko lu pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu kyamate Okrasi e pwu idɛnyi nzu akwɛyi ra lakwunyɔ wu e shi Kyamate kiya ingyi umbwɔ ferere ingyi isabɔ laa Ukpo tayi. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />kwuwongu lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo awu, kwɔkyɛ la la lo pwa ngwu te lu yama naa lu wo rara mo, moo ɛlɛ ishoshi te ɛmɛ umba Ukpo lo wo mo. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Iso iyi ira mbala iso iyi erendo mbala ɛnɛ iyi ira tete li wɔ mu kenzu yi mo. Ukpo iduma gba i fate la lu wo le. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Lunyi la lu yitu te, u to kaya, naa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wuluma mo naa u wo ekweyi, mo onzu awu tayi, e yi kyamate u byi eshi eshi ayi, e fye mu kwogba ungwu Ukpo mo. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />La lu shi onzu uwunawuna le kyoro yi mo mbala iso iyi umbwa mo, kwuwongu meka iyi iso ɛlɛ te gba amba umba Ukpo o fu mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomo mo le. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ lunyi la lu kyomesu mbala mba mo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Moo mekyi, lu yi mu ipwu, kekelele ba lu yi mu ɛbɛ iyi Ɔkwu ŋa le. La lu zɛ luzɛ undu ɛbɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />La lu lolo te ɛbɛ i bo la kiya ingyi esheshi mbala ototo mbala ongbulolo. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Lunyi la lu gyakpɔɔ kaa la lu wo kiya ingyi ki she la Ukpo. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Lunyi la lu kyo mu apula iyi umbwa iyi ipwu mo. Lunyi ba la lu ta mba undu kwudu. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Moo akwu kiya ingyi lovya kaa enzu umba Ukpo lo ba eza mbala esu wɛrɛrɛ meka iyira iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbira o wo. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o bo ngyi kwudu o ma ngyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Moo ɛbɛ gba i shi o ma kiya ingyinangyina le. A kwu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba o ka te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Nyeyimo mu ondo, uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu ondo awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">La lu nyeyimo lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu kpomo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">akwɛyi Okrasi e shi yi ɛbɛ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la lu gbɛndu kaa la lu yi kyamate erendo mo, la lu yi kyamate enzu umba amasa tayi. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />kwuyengwu lu fya, la lu wo ɛduma mangwu, moo kwuye kwɔlɛ akwu kwuyengwura. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />kwuwo ngwɔlɛ la lu wo kyamate erendo mo, lunyi ba la lu kyakpɔ kaa lu yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />La lu wo embyi umba bɔkɔ o tutu yi mo mo. Lunyi ba la lu shi Kwundu kaa lakwu u zɔ yi ɔgwuzɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Lunyi la lu shi esu egbo mɛzhi mu amu iyi Ukpo isomo. La lu so amu la Ɔkwu nzu la iduma mu egbo yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />La lu koko lu gbɛlɛ Ada ɔsu Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwo ungwu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e wo lɛɛbi mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />kwuwongu inzumbɛku iyi ki shi Okrasi, la lu lomo laa esu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iŋɔma Iyi Oko Mbala Ɔnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Eko lunyi la lo anu yi ma kyamate Ɔkwu tayi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Moo ɔnu gba akwu u to keyi uwu oko wu le, kyamate bɔkɔ Okrasi gba akwu u to keyi uwu ɔshɔshi le awu. Okrasi mafyi wu gba akwu usama uwu ɔshɔshi le, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɛnwu wu. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Tayi gba i yi le eko akwu mɛga kaa la lu lomo laa umba anu yi kyamate bɔkɔ ɔshɔshi mafyi wu e lomo laa Okrasi tayi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Anu, la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi eko yi kyamate bɔkɔ Okrasi e pwu idɛnyi iyi ɔshɔshi wu akwɛyi a nyama kaa le kpomo kwuwo mbo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Okrasi e wo ɛlɛ kaa le to ɔshɔshi wu le shi Ukpo i zɛ mu iso wu, iyi bɔkɔ akwu igbɔma sɛsɛ mu embyi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />kaa le to ɔshɔshi uwu bɔkɔ e yi kwuto mo, e yi ɛnyinyi mo, ba e yi kɛrikɛri kaa le shi la ɛnwu wu. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Anu tete la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi eko yi kyamate lu pwu idɛnyi iyi ɛnwu yi tayi. Ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi oko wu e pwu idɛnyi iyi ɛnwu wu. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo anya iyi ɛnwu wu, e yi mo. Onzu uwunawuna e ri kiya, a gba a bɔ eyi mɛnwu kyamate Okrasi e yese mbaa ɔshɔshi tayi, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />moo lɛɛbi nzu ki kwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi.) <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ ɔzɔnu a lafya la ete wu mbala anyi wu kaa le kyomesu mbala oko wu, akwɛyi wepepo mbo o kwu wakpɛnyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Iso ɛlɛ i kɔ mu izɔngɔma. Imi ba mi zɔngɔma yi ma te ɛlɛ akwu iso iyi Okrasi mbala ɔshɔshi wu. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ɛlɛ ba ikyo yi tete tee: akwu mega kaa ɔnu uwunawuna la pwu idɛnyi iyi oko wu kyamate ɛnwu wu tayi. Tatayi oko uwunawuna ba akwu mega kaa le lomo la ɔnu wu.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛmɛ Mbala Umba Ada Mbala Umba Ɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Ɛmɛ, la lu lo umba eteyi mbala umba anyi yi ma kwuwongu lu kwu umba Ukpo, moo ɛlɛ gba akwu kiya ingyi esheshi te kaa lu wo le. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo e so mu kwokpo wu te, &lt;&lt;Lo la ada ŋa mbala ɛnɛ ŋɔ ma&gt;&gt; ɛlɛ gba akwu ɛrama iyi kwonze, iyi kenzu igyirima unga Ukpo le. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Gba lu wo ɛlɛ, &lt;&lt;ishoshi i shi yi akwɛyi lu yi kwunyɔ ungwu wɔzhi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Lunyi umba ada, la lu shi ɛmɛ yi amba mo, lunyi ba la lu zɔ mba luzɛ undu ɛzɔ iyi Ɔkwu i zɔ awu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enye Mbala Ada Umba Agba Mba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Enye, la lu wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ada umbagba yi o so yi te la lu wo, la lu lo mbo mo, la lu mbwalu iso mbo mu egbo ikpɛnyi kyamate lu lomo la Okrasi tayi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />La lu lo ada umbagba yi ma mu kwuyengwu o ye yi mu eyi ibɔma kaa lu fya kwupwɔ bi mo. Lunyi ba la lu lo mbo mo kyamate enye umba Okrasi tayi, la lu wo kiya ingyi Ukpo a gyite lu wo mu egbo yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />La lu gbo mbo rinye mu egbo ikpɛnyi kyamate Ɔkwu gba lu gbo wu le tayi, moo akwu onzu gba lu gbo wu le mo. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Lunyi la lu yitu te Ukpo ee shi uwewe rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ e wo, laa enye, laa umba bɔkɔ akwu enye mo. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Tatayi lunyi Ada umbagba la lu wo iyeshi la enye yi. La lu lo mbo inyashi mo. Lunyi la lu lolo te lunyi mbala mba lu yi adakwogba ukpɛnyi uwu e yi moshi, uwu ba a zɔ kusɛ mo.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewulo Iyi Ɛwa Itomo Iyi Enzu Wambwalu Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Imbwambwa iyi iso mi gba i yi te, la lu wo ekpasu, la lu rima kpakiri mu ekpasu iyɛku iyi Ɔkwu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ewulo iyi ewa iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi awu, la lu lo yi mɛnwu kaa la lu kiri ewa mbala onzu uwoyi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Moo ewa nzu akwu mbala enzu mo, ewa nzu akwu mbala ɛndu iyira mbala asu umba bɔkɔ o yi idomo mbala ekpasu iyi ipwu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala ɛndu iyira moshi. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la lu lo ewulo iyi ewa iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi awu mɛnwu, akwɛyi kwuyengwu onzu uwoyi e bo munyi yi, lu rima lu shi wu eyi mɛnwu. kwuyengwu lu mbwa ewa ɛlɛ lomo, la lu rima ngiri kpɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la lu rima ngiri. La lu ma ongbulolo muzhi yi kyamate kwɔbɛlu tayi. La lu lo ototo uwu Ukpo mɛnwu kyamate kwokpata ungwu ewa tayi, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />la lu yi ɛnwu ma kaa la lu tanu iyi iyesheshi iyi idigbomo kyamate bɔkɔ onzu e lo ekpoyata malɛ tayi. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Kekelele lunyi la lu to ikwu idu fulo kyamate kwundu tayi; kwuwongu mbala yi gba lu nyi ɔyi uwu ogwu uwu onzu uwoyi uwu bɔkɔ e towu awu ma le. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />La lu bɔ kipu unga kwoso kaa la kwu isama yi mbala iso iyi Ukpo, iyi bɔkɔ i yi mate ukpandɛrɛ tayi uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu ee shi le. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Kwuye ungwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi yimo, la lu lɛ Ukpo. La lu ngbɛndu iyɔkpɔɔ, la lu koko lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwongu enzu wu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />La lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwo mi tete kaa kwuye ngwunangwuna ungwu bɔkɔ mi ya kenzu mo kaa la mi siso wu, la mi so la iyi mo. Akwɛyi iso iyi nvyemo iyi Ukpo, mi wa yi kwudu gedegede. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />A kwu kwuwongu ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ gba Imi, onzu uwu ɛduma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, o ta mi mugu ugyi le. La lu lɛ Ukpo ka la mi siso ɛlɛ kaa la mi riyi mo.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Iyi Ɔpɔlu Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Umɛnɛ mi uwu idɛnyi Otakiku Umɛgba uwu Ɔkwu uwu bɔkɔ o fulo idu ma wu e so yi lɛɛbi onzu uwu bɔkɔ mi kwu mbala iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu iwomo. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ gba mi lɔ wu kaa le so munyi yi kaa la lu yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki ye nzu mu iwomo, kaa le kyo la ka yi ɛnwu mo. <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Mi lɛ Ukpo te le shi ɛmɛnɛ mi idigbomo, idɛnyi mbala ikwu idu fulo mu Ukpo ete nzu mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Mi lɛ Ukpo te esheshi wu li yi mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o pwu idɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala idɛnyi iyɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>